    [205218]={status="ok",name="Libram of Discovery",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nLibram\nClasses: Paladin\nRequires Level 5\nEngrave your cloak with the Soul Siphon rune:\nIncreases health drained or damage done by your Drain Life, Drain Soul, and Wrack spells by 20%.\n\"Achieve a state of Inspiration by slaying 5 foes, then use to learn a new ability.\""},
    [205420]={status="ok",name="Libram of Judgement",quality=2,tip="Item Level 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nLibram\nClasses: Paladin\nEngrave your gloves with the Crusader Strike rune:\n\"Learn a new ability after unleashing 10 seals onto your enemies\"",undatamined=true},
    [206376]={status="ok",name="Bulwark Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune:\nEach time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value.\nIn addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond (60 * 5). Lasts 15 sec.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\""},
    [206381]={status="ok",name="Dyadic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your chest or robe with the Overload rune:\nGives your Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning spells a 30% chance to cast a second, similar spell on the same target at no additional cost that causes half damage and no threat.\n\"Learn a new ability after receiving Nature damage 10 times.\""},
    [206382]={status="ok",name="Tempest Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 10\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune:\nThe caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water. When a spell, melee, or ranged attack hits the caster or when one of the caster's healing spells gets a critical result, 2% of maximum mana is restored to the caster, expending one water globe. Only one globe will activate every few seconds. Lasts 10 min.\nOnly one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting 10 non-player enemies with 3 different elements (Nature, Frost, Fire).\"",undatamined=true},
    [206383]={status="ok",name="Lithic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your pants with the Earth Shield rune:\nProtects the target with an earthen shield, reducing casting or channeling time lost when damaged by 30% and causing attacks to heal the shielded target for [28 * (29.888200 + 0.690312 * 60 + 0.136267 * 60 * 60) / 100]. This effect can only occur once every few seconds. 9 charges. Lasts 10 min. Earth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time.\n\"Learn a new ability after blocking 20 attacks with your shield.\""},
    [206384]={status="ok",name="Astral Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",undatamined=true},
    [206385]={status="ok",name="Clastic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your pants with the Way of Earth rune:\nWhile Rockbiter Weapon is active on your main hand weapon and you have a shield equipped, you deal 65% increased threat, gain 30% increased health, take 10% reduced damage, gain 6% reduced chance to be critically hit by melee attacks, and Earth Shock taunts targets to attack you and has a separate cooldown from other Shock spells but has its range reduced to melee range. However, the range of your Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, Chain Heal, Healing Wave, and Lava Burst spells is reduced by 20 yards.\n\"Learn a new ability after defeating 20 enemies with Earth Shock.\""},
    [206386]={status="ok",name="Galvanic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune:\nEach time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value.\nIn addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond (60 * 5). Lasts 15 sec.\n\"Learn a new ability after defeating enemies 10 times with Lightning Bolt.\""},
    [206387]={status="ok",name="Kajaric Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 25\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your gloves with the Lava Burst rune:\nYou hurl molten lava at the target, dealing 150 to 192 Fire damage. If your Flame Shock is on the target, Lava Burst deals 20% increased damage.\n\"Learn a new ability after taking damage from lava 5 times. (Reduces damage from some sources of lava)\""},
    [206388]={status="ok",name="Sulfurous Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your gloves with the Molten Blast rune:\nBlast up to 10 enemies in a cone in front of you for [(7.583798 + 0.471881 * 60 + 0.036599 * 60 * 60) * 72 / 100 + 5 / 100 * Attack Power] to [(7.583798 + 0.471881 * 60 + 0.036599 * 60 * 60) * 108 / 100 + 5 / 100 * Attack Power] Fire damage. This ability generates a high amount of threat. Flame Shock periodic damage has a 10% chance to reset the cooldown on Molten Blast.\n\"Learn a new ability after defeating 10 enemies with Earth Shock.\""},
    [206389]={status="ok",name="Brimstone Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your belt with the Fire Nova rune:\nYour Fire Nova Totem spell is replaced with Fire Nova, which causes your current Fire totem to emit damage at its location.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\""},
    [206390]={status="ok",name="Ichthyan Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune:\nThe caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water. When a spell, melee, or ranged attack hits the caster or when one of the caster's healing spells gets a critical result, 2% of maximum mana is restored to the caster, expending one water globe. Only one globe will activate every few seconds. Lasts 10 min.\nOnly one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",undatamined=true},
    [206391]={status="ok",name="Syzygic Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your bracers with the Riptide\nrune:\nHeals a friendly target for 486 to 534, an additional 445 over 15 sec, and increases the effectiveness of your Chain Heal casts directly on that target by 25%.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",undatamined=true},
    [206954]={status="ok",name="Idol of Ursine Rage",quality=2,tip="Item Level 10\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nIdol\nClasses: Druid\nEngrave your gloves with the Mangle rune:\nBite the target, dealing 100% normal damage plus 26 and generating a high amount of threat.\n\"Learn a new ability after keeping your rage in Bear Form at 50 or higher for 60 seconds\""},
    [208222]={status="ok",name="Old Guard Retaliator",quality=2,tip="Item Level 57\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nTwo-Hand\nAxe\n131 - 197 Damage\nSpeed 3.70\n(44.32 damage per second)\n+5 Strength\n+5 Agility\n+8 Stamina\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Warrior\nEquip: On landing a killing blow that grants experience or honor, your next attack will critically strike.\n\"The previous owner immaculately cared for this weapon.\"\nSell Price: 8 10 41"},
    [208414]={status="ok",name="Lunar Idol",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nIdol\nClasses: Druid\nEngrave your chest or robe with the Fury of Stormrage rune:\nReduces the mana cost of Wrath by 100% and each time you deal damage with Wrath you have a 12% chance for your next cast of Healing Touch within 15 sec to be instant and castable in any shapeshift form. Allows Wrath to be cast while in Tree of Life form.\n\"Defeat 6 creatures affected by your Moonfire, then use to learn a new ability.\""},
    [208424]={status="ok",name="Sun Shades",quality=2,tip="Item Level 100\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nHead\nCloth\n101 Armor\nDurability 99 / 99\nRequires Astral Perfect Victory\n\"Do not stare directly at bright objects.\"\nSell Price: 1"},
    [208689]={status="ok",name="Ferocious Idol",quality=2,tip="Item Level 20\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nIdol\nClasses: Druid\nEngrave your pants with the Savage Roar rune:\nRequires Cat Form\nFinishing move that increases Physical damage done by 30% while in Cat Form. Lasts longer per combo point:\n1 point : (14 + 0) seconds\n2 points: (19 + 0) seconds\n3 points: (24 + 0) seconds\n4 points: (29 + 0) seconds\n5 points: (34 + 0) seconds\n\"Deal 20 instances of bleeding damage to humanoids, then use this idol to learn a new ability.\""},
    [208849]={status="ok",name="Libram of Blessings",quality=2,tip="Item Level 10\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nLibram\nClasses: Paladin\nEngrave your chest with the Hallowed Ground rune:\nYour Consecration now also heals party members within its area for 200% of Consecration's damage value.\n\"Learn a new ability after giving blessings to 5 different players\""},
    [208851]={status="ok",name="Libram of Justice",quality=2,tip="Item Level 10\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nLibram\nClasses: Paladin\nEngrave your gloves with the Hand of Reckoning rune:\n\"Learn a new ability after slaying 10 enemies stunned by Hammer of Justice\"",undatamined=true},
