    [239512]={status="ok",name="Lightbreaker Wrists",quality=4,tip="Sanctified\nItem Level 98\nBinds when picked up\nWrist\nPlate\n477 Armor\n+29 Strength\n+10 Agility\n+13 Stamina\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Warrior\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%.\nEquip: Increases your attack speed and casting speed by 1.0%.\nLightbreaker's Warplate (0/8)\nLightbreaker Greathelm\nLightbreaker Shoulders\nLightbreaker Cuirass\nLightbreaker Belt\nLightbreaker Tassets\nLightbreaker Greaves\nLightbreaker Wrists\nLightbreaker Grips\n(2) Set : Your Heroic Strike, Cleave, and Quick Strike damage is increased by 20% while in Battle Stance or Berserker Stance. Your Cleave strikes 1 additional target and can trigger Blood Surge.\n(4) Set : Each time you hit a target with Whirlwind, Heroic Strike, Quick Strike, or Cleave, the damage of your next Slam is increased by 20%, stacking up to 5 times.\n(6) Set : Each time Deep Wounds deals damage, it reduces the remaining cooldown on your Whirlwind by 3 sec. Whirlwind deals 100% increased damage to targets afflicted with your Deep Wounds.\nSell Price: 5 5 27"},
